<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <!--
      Intentionally minimal.

      myKikau is distributed directly from the website, not the Mac App Store, so it
      does NOT use App Sandbox: cleanup, uninstall/leftover-teardown, and LaunchAgent
      management need broader filesystem and process access than the sandbox permits.
      See docs/MODERNIZATION_REVIEW.md (§5) for why this was a deliberate choice.

      No Hardened Runtime exceptions (com.apple.security.cs.*) are needed today.
      Add one here only when a specific feature genuinely requires it, and note why —
      each exception weakens a protection notarization is meant to guarantee.
    -->
</dict>
</plist>
